                    R&D area
                     주요 업무
                  
                  
                    Mechanical Design
                      (기구설계)
                    - Low impedance, transparent actuation system design
                      - Robot hardware design
                      - Robot customization (개인화) research
                      - Sim-to-real gap minimization
                  
                  
                    Circuit Design
                      (회로설계)
                    - Sensor design and verification
                      - Analog / digital sensor-signal processing 
                      - AI processing circuit design
                      - Power circuit (e.g., motor driver) design
                  
                  
                    Artificial Intelligence
                      (인공지능)
                    - Human-in-the-loop optimization
                      - Human-robot integrative simulation
                      - Reinforcement learning for robot control
                      - Motion recognition for the diagnosis of diseases
                  
                  
                    Data
                      (데이터)
                    - User application design and development for data gathering
                      - Human-robot integrative big-data management
                      - Data standardization and normalization
                      - Management of data-cloud (AWS)
                  
                  
                    Control
                      (제어)
                    - Real-time control for nonlinearity compensation (friction, etc)
                      - Real-time control for assistance of human motion
                      - Real-time control for actuator control
                      - Robustness enhancement
                      - Sim-to-real gap minimization
                  
                
                
                
              
          
        
    
    
      
    
    
      
          
